Begin Instruction Section


# Thread 1 code add 2 number and print the result
1020 SET 10 17            # R17 = 0 (first multiplier)
1021 SET 12 18            # R18 = 0 (second multiplier)
1022 ADDI 17 18           # R18 = R17 + R18 (R18 = first multiplier + second multiplier)
1023 CPY 18 20            # R20 = R18 (result)
1024 SYSCALL PRN 20       # Print the result

End Instruction Section